  "limitations": [
    "Native Quack qualification requires the pinned DuckOnWire engine and protocol 7. The tested stock Node DuckDB v1.5.6 engine rejected the paired extension; other engine/protocol combinations are not qualified.",
    "Native CMake builds the C/C++ engine, server, examples and tests. The other eight native Quack bindings were paired and tested separately in historical rc.3 macOS qualification; they are not fresh rc.4/rc.5 native binding results.",
    "Ten stock PostgreSQL language drivers passed on macOS. Current Linux PostgreSQL CI qualifies C/Python/Node; full native Linux CI qualifies C/C++, transactions, concurrency and installed packages. Historical remote rc.3 results remain separate.",
    "Six recorded workload runs are measured examples, not hardware-normalized comparisons or WAN performance guarantees.",
    "The selected DuckDB/Quack fork sources include the canonical changes. Fresh binary acceptance is reported separately by GitHub Actions and release package manifests; historical result files remain unchanged."
  ],
